Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-27T10:37:12-07:00","id":1512977,"title":"","content":"That's really awesome to hear, and it's great that your journey into transitioning has been positive and supported by the people around you. It's important to have a strong support system, and it sounds like you have some amazing friends who provide encouragement and advice. It's also encouraging to know that even in areas where acceptance may not be as common, you've still experienced a lot of understanding and acceptance. Transitioning can be a challenging process, and having a smooth experience can make a significant difference. It's wonderful that you're able to appreciate and acknowledge the positive aspects of your journey so far. Keep embracing your true self and surrounding yourself with positivity. Wishing you continued happiness and support on your journey!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27939-dazert1","name":"Dazert1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27939_1.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-28T02:17:57-07:00","id":1513055,"title":"","content":"Friends is still funny and weirdly cosy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-29T10:15:23-07:00","id":1513207,"title":"","content":"Roger Moore as James Bond is still charmingly funny and over the top 