ashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-17T10:03:46-07:00","id":1518182,"title":"","content":"I love watching criminal investigation reports on the ID channel or a lesser extent A&amp;E and see how cases come together due to well thought research and smart detectives and lawyers that just present the facts and don't make it something that it's not or completely fall apart due to unchecked ego, ineptness or tunnel vision.<br /> <br /> The murders of Tupac &amp; Biggie Smalls is one the cases I watched carefully when they worked on it on ID along with a few novels that covered the case.<br /> <br /> On a side note I found Tim Burton's Batman film crammed with all sorts of special features and I wonder if I will like the film now as much as I did as 12/13 year old.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 07-17-2023, 01:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-18T22:21:59-07:00","id":1518295,"title":"","content":"I love being a dude, as weird as that sounds. I like masculinity and I like being masculine. Even before I made my transition and became my true self, I was a massive tomboy pretty much from the time I was little. And I'm very happy that I can live in a time and place I can be my true self in full and with a husband who gets that about me and loves it too.<br /> <br /> And that's not a dig at femininity or womanhood either. If you're a woman, be you cis or trans, or if you're a more feminine-leaning non-binary/agender person or any other gender identity, embrace and enjoy that aspect of your life as much as I enjoy and embrace the masculine aspects of my life.<br /> <br /> Gender positivity is a wonderful thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-22T09:50:57-07:00","id":1518540,"title":"","content":"NSFW Matt Corleone? I'm not up on the latest lingo anymore and I never really was to be fair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2736