":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-15T07:44:12-07:00","id":1520671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1520559#post1520559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Got a coupon on my Subway app for a 5.99 footlong. But they goofed and it was 5.99 after everything was added. So I loaded it up with double meat, bacon, guac and everything I possibly could. It ended up being $27.75. And then only 5.99 at the checkout. I gave the guy behind the counter a $10 tip and still came out way ahead.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now, that is awesome!<br /> <br /> I remember one time, I went to Sbarro's and ordered two slices of Pepperoni. They gave me three slices but only charged me for the two I ordered. It was an oversight since they seemed to be understaffed that day and there was a long line but I ain't gonna turn down a free extra slice of pepperoni pizza!<br /> <br /> I tipped extra though since I felt bad for the folks there being overworked and understaffed, but still.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"