ebooks for Werewolf: The Apocalypse and Changeling: The Dreaming both for $15 bucks a piece along with some extra Changeling supplements.<br /> <br /> I made sure to do all the housework the night before so the two of us had nothing but free time. <br /> <br /> I ended the day by going to sleep with a smile on my face, warmth in my heart, G-Fuel in my tummy, and hubby's seed in my butt. I was content as could be.<br /> <br /> That day was soo good that I didn't even have to use my AK! lol<br /> <br /> Still feeling good today too. Had to do a little bit of household chores but got 'em done quick. Now I'm just sitting here at home while hubby's at work, posting on the forums, enjoying some Sweet Red, and just grooving to some music.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qt6Lkgs0kiU\" data-code=\"Qt6Lkgs0kiU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Qt6Lkgs0kiU/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-15T14:52:58-07:00","id":1520710,"title":"","content":"The Ataris had a good tune here.","si