!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-15T14:59:51-07:00","id":1520712,"title":"","content":"Rob Zombie is a great musician and his movies are not to everyone's taste, though I did like his twist on his two Halloween films that included his wife Sheri Moon and having it not as a straight on remake that some people were guessing it was going to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-15T15:11:12-07:00","id":1520715,"title":"","content":"I mean Rob Zombie even said it was going to be a reboot and not a remake and that should've been the first clue that he was going to put his own twist on it as it is on all things being rebooted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 08-15-2023, 06:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-15T15:18:05-07:00","id":1520716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1520712#post1520712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rob Zombie is a great musician and his movies are not to everyone's taste, though I did like his twist on his two Halloween films that included his wife Sheri Moon and having it not as a straight on remake that some people were guessing it was going to be.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair point, I get why some people liked his remake of the first Halloween, but I could never get into it.<br /> <br /> For some damn reason, almost every Rob Zombie movie seems to have to have either rednecks, his wife's flat ass, or all of the above. The Munsters was a major exception and that was because he had to keep it PG, lol.<br /> <br /> Now, don't get me wrong, I grew up kinda trashy and redneck and I love seeing naked asses of all shapes and sizes, but for some reason Rob Zombie just overdoes the redneck/White trash thing.<br /> <br /> With the Firefly Family trilogy, it actually works given that those movies were like a throwback to the whole &quot;hick exploitation horror&quot; subgenre of the 70's and 80's but with Halloween, it loses its charm and becomes too much.<br /> <br /> For me, part of what made Michael Myers appealing was because he was just a seemingly normal guy from a fairly normal and functional middle-class suburban family in the more blue part of the Midwest. Nobody could figure out why he was a psychopatic and sadistic killer, he just was. <br /> <br /> Giving Myers a backstory where his parents were trashy rednecks who mistreated him just kinda felt lame to me but that's just my personal opinion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-17T15:31:55-07:00","id":1520840,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to some possible rain showers tomorrow to cool off the heatwave we've been dealing with for most of this week and maybe clearing up some the smoky air I've been seeing from the wildfires from British Columbia &amp; the Northwest Terrorities. I do hope that the people from YellowKnife will get some relief soon as they been ordered to leave this morning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysan