ct-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MEWgOlTIW4Y\" data-code=\"MEWgOlTIW4Y\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/MEWgOlTIW4Y/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Started playing. It's great fun so far. I especially love how it's now an established aesthetic in how they mix live-action-visuals with in-game-stuff. And continuing with what Control established that both Alan Wake and Control happen in the same universe is also nice... although it makes me wonder how someone who has neither played Alan Wake nor Control would react to this game that is so heavy with references.<br /> <br /> So far the light-mechanic hasn't been too annoying as well. I remember getting really frustrated in some spots in Alan Wake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-29T22:01:25-07:00","id":1524735,"title":"","content":"I love cuddling with my hubby and watching episodes of Ouran High School Host Club together","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avat