ention with some panels on Friday, Saturday, and Sunday as well as a merch room.<br /> <br /> At the keynote panel on Friday they had a slide show talking about the event as a whole and after announcing all the staff and everything they said they wanted to introduce the most famous person there, and they pulled up a slide with my name on it and had me stand up! I was freaking out!!! Everyone clapped and cheered, it was so awesome!! I didn\u2019t expect that! So all weekend I had some people stop to talk to me about character sheets, and some even took pictures with me. It was great! Definitely a highlight moment for me!<br /> <br /> The LARP itself was really cool too! It was awesome seeing everyone dressed up, some of them went all out! Plus it was just fun watching all the interactions and seeing bits of the main story play out. The venue was really nice too! They had it at the <a href=\"https://imss.org/\" target=\"_blank\">International Museum of Surgical Science</a>!<br /> <br /> They posted up some of the professional pictures they had taken at the event, so I thought I'd share a link for those. Somehow a picture of my wife and I is the first pic in the gallery. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/200765945@N06/albums/72177720317833938/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.flickr.com/photos/200765...7720317833938/</a><br /> <br /> Anyway, sorry to brag a bit, I just had to share that! We had an amazing time and I'm really glad we went! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _____________________________