tiveness of certain tactical moves or the fact that he would do it himself with little to no help.<br /> <br /> Sorry if I was going up against Wolverine and my plans were to overload his heightened senses and healing factor. I would still want a highly motivated and trained team to assist me. You can bet Wolverine would know that they would use his powers against him and come up with ways to fight through.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 03-08-2025, 05:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-08T04:59:07-08:00","id":1549072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1549060#post1549060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been enjoying watching a YouTube channel called Multiversial Wisdom that has Batman coming up with plans to counter superhumans from various intellectual properties. It's fun to watch even if I don't agree with the effectiveness of certain tactical moves or the fact that he would do it himself with little to no help.<br /> <br /> Sorry if I was going up again Wolverine and my plans were to overload his heightened senses and healing factor. I would still want a highly motivated and trained team to assist me. You can bet Wolverine would know that they would use his powers against him and come up with ways to fight through.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh cool. I'll have to check out that channel sometimes..<br /> <br /> And Wolverine is probably my favorite comic character. I still have a ton of Wolverine comics in my collection. Nothing from the last 15 years probably, but I have a ton of the old comics. And yea, he'd definitely be a hard one to beat. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-08T12:22:41-08:00","id":1549089,"title":"","content":"It does sound like the creators understand Batman though... Bruce really doesn't like the idea of enemies he can't default solo if he has enough time to prepare for the fight. Teammates are a bonus in his manner of thinking, not a default. One of the DC animated movies did a great job of highlighting Bat's mentality about this: when the Justice League finds out that he has plans for soloing all of the other members (which got stolen and used by the Legion of Doom), he reveals why he got out of his trap so easily comparatively: his real plan against himself is making sure the JL is on the right path because their teamwork is the only way to stop a Batman that crosses the line.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-08T14:10:24-08:00","id":1549090,"title":"","content":"They do Heavy Arms and as a major Batman fan myself, I greatly enjoy the channel. My only criticism is that Batman doesn't always bring in help when it should be needed like my Wolverine example and the Dark Knight doesn't hold the patent on being a highly motivated and skilled fighter and strategist and that there are others who can equal or surpass him.<br /> <br /> Plus the old adage of the best laid plans don't always survive contact with reality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-08T22:04:29-08:00","id":1549099,"title":"","content":"Batman, Green Lantern and Iron Man were my particular favorites from straight up superhero comics. I wish I kept from Transformers comics from Marvel and kept them in better condition Mr. Gone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 03-09-2025, 01:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-10T04:37:36-07:00","id":1549124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1549090#post1549090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They do Heavy Arms and as a major Batman fan myself, I greatly enjoy the channel. My only criticism is that Batman doesn't always bring in help when it should be needed like my Wolverine example and the Dark Knight doesn't hold the patent on being a highly motivated and skilled fighter and strategist and that there are others who can equal or surpass him.<br /> <br /> Plus the old adage of the best laid plans don't always survive contact with reality.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, glad to hear you enjoy it! And yea, I know how it goes with these sometimes. Batman should definitely be calling in more help sometimes... but even in the comics sometimes he doesn't. LOL.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1549099#post1549099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Batman, Green Lantern and Iron Man were my particular favorites from straight up superhero comics.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was always more of an X-Men fan, but I did like Batman sometimes. Never collected a lot of those comics for whatever reason. But, Green Lantern and Iron Man are cool..<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1549099#post1549099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wish I kept from Transformers comics from Marvel and kept them in better condition Mr. Gone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aww, sorry about that. Totally know how it goes though. Theres a few things I'd wish I'd kept too...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone