quot;Arcane&quot;, and explained to her that automatic-doors don't open for me, I don't appear well on film and people forgot who I am and she just laughed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Happens to me sometimes! Glad I'm not alone.. LOL","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-16T01:43:34-07:00","id":1551062,"title":"","content":"Been really enjoying Claire Obscure: Expedition 33. It's probably the best turn based JRPG-style game I've played in several decades. The visual, music and gameplay are all topnotch. I also really like how the game isn't interested in holding your hand. <br /> <br /> There's no minimap, so you're encouraged to explore and get a bit lost. Narratively, the characters are familiar with certain settings concepts, so they talk and discuss things but don't stop to explain them (since everyone involved already knows this stuff) so it's up to the player to pay attention and pick up stuff based on context. And then mechanically, the combat doesn't hold your hand either. It has a QTE style parry/dodge mechanic and a bit of a Dark Soul's mentality. It's assumed you'll die a few times fighting enemies while you get the timing on their attack patterns down. <br /> <br /> One interesting thing is that some bosses have certain tricks you can exploit, but the game doesn't call out or mention them. Like there was one boss who had a charge up move and then the next turn threw out a devastating attack that could wipe you if you didn't get the dodge timing right. After dying 5 times I realized there was a variation in the charge up move and figured out how how to interrupt him. The game never called attention to it, which I thought was kind of refreshing because most games in this style would shove your face in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-16T05:08:56-07:00","id":1551064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1551062#post1551062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Been really enjoying Claire Obscure: Expedition 33.</div> </div> </div> </div>Never heard before, but now I want it. I'll probably get the PS5 version later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{