alue":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-15T14:32:37-07:00","id":1551687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1551679#post1551679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm amazed sometimes how quickly a social media personality can get a large following in a short time.<br /> <br /> I'm referring to Youtuber Voice of The Emperor who has only been doing his channel since late April and has already 1.1 K suscribers.</div> </div> </div> </div>My wife is one of those 1.1 K (actually 1.2 right now). She has a lot of W 40K channels.<br /> <br /> Currently I'm finally playing Expedition 33. I'm also alternating it with Catherine Full Body, because by itself 33 is <u><b>extremely</b></u> melancholic and I can't stand it a full afternoon. And Catherine is also an amazing (if old) game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-06-15T15:14:03-07:00","id":1551691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldqu