\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't have an amazing summer, because it's winter here, but I'm good. The weather is nice and things are going well at work.<br /> <br /> . . .</div> </div> </div> </div>Southern Brazil?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-07T17:06:14-07:00","id":1552174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iguazu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1552157#post1552157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Southern Brazil?</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually about the middle of the country.<br /> <br /> Only the far North of the country is in the Northern Hemisphere, and the idea that seasons don't exist in the tropics is a little exaggerated.<br /> <br /> I mean, where I live it's considered freezing cold when the temperature is about 15\u00ba C or below, and it won't get much lower than that. I've never personally seen snow in my life. Depending on many factors, this temperature remains during the whole day in the winter. In the summer here we can get as high as 36\u00ba C, so we're still talking about 20\u00ba of difference.<br /> <br /> There are places that vary considerably less, and others that vary considerably more, I'm not really near the Equator here. I'm from Bras\u00edlia.<br /> <br /> But on topic: my wife is now playing Dave the Diver and loving it. I like to watch her playing and having fun. I'm finally reading Demon, the Descent, although I'm not sure it's my cup of tea (it's focused on espionage, which isn't a genre I like a lot).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-08T14:48:59-07:00","id":1552216,"title":"","content":"Don\u2019t sing love songs<br /> You\u2019ll wake my mother<br /> She\u2019s sleeping here<br /> Right by my side<br /> And in her right hand<br /> A silver dagger<br /> She says that I<br /> Can\u2019t be your bride<br /> <br /> The first verse of Joan Baez\u2019s Silver Dagger<br /> <br /> One of my favorite songs","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:",