umbers are and the capitalist Auntie's Choice channel's promoting a musical about how the company got founded, for example. Stuff like that. Definitely had a good time. I wouldn't put it on my GOTY-list but it was pretty good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh nice! Glad to hear you liked it! I loved the original Outer Worlds, so I'm excited to play the new one! I'm playing Ghost of Yotei at the moment(just started it basically), so it'll be a bit before I start Outer World 2.<br /> <br /> Ghost of Yotei is pretty good so far though!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-22T06:37:05-08:00","id":1555755,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1555753#post1555753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh nice! Glad to hear you liked it! I loved the original Outer Worlds, so I'm excited to play the new one! I'm playing Ghost of Yotei at the moment(just started it basically), so it'll be a bit before I start Outer World 2.<br /> <br /> Ghost of Yotei is pretty good so far though!</div> </div> </div> </div>I gotta say, though... Between the first one and the second one, Parvati is still my favorite character. That earnest sweetness of her character still stands out, I think.<br /> <br /> Yeah, Ghost of Yotei is the one I didn't start instead of Outer Worlds 2 lol. I'm probably gonna play it like Tsushima: Wait for the PC-release with all the DLC and whatnot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-22T13:01:26-08:00","id":1555763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1555755#post1555755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I gotta say, though... Between the first one and the second one, Parvati is still my favorite character. That earnest sweetness of her character still stands out, I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aww, thats cool that Parvati maintains her charac