w and that is a strong part of the charming absurdity of the genre.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hear ya! It's what was fun about it back when I was collecting comics. But I gotta say, once you get out and then start looking into what you missed it gets crazy. LOL! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-09T15:55:26-08:00","id":1558212,"title":"","content":"Yes especially when a certain villain character gets popular and becomes a hero of sorts they have to get creative to explain the change. For example in GI-Joe from it time in Marvel Comics when they decided to change that it wasn't Storm Shadow that tried to kill Snake Eyes at the Dojo and would wind up killing The Hard Master. Storm Shadow becomes a popular character and becomes a hero and they decided it was Zartan that was the one who tried to kill Snake Eyes.<br /> <br /> But this created new problems as people pointed out is why Zartan was there as neither G