e been caught before ignoring that detail.</div> </div> </div> </div>What a shocker, that the organization given the task of carrying out assassinations of foreign leaders would be involved with clandestined operations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-22T16:57:02-07:00","id":1562065,"title":"","content":"I guess Taco Bell isn't doing to great financially due to the whole lettuce issue. I saw on the app today that they're selling their encheritos (basically burritois in enchilada sauce) for only 1$ and you can buy up to 5 of them. So I got 5 encheritos and ate one put the others in the fridge. Now I will have an encherito a day for the rest of the week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":2},{"type":"\ud83e\udd22","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-22T22:48:58-07:00","id":1562074,"title":"","content":"The trailer for Avengers Doomsday seems okay, but it didn't get the same reaction out of me when I saw Supergirl Woman of Tomorrow trailer drop. Maybe later trailers will make me more interested.<br /> <br /> Though seeing Robert Downey Jr doing a Eastern European accent was a selling point.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-24T04:35:15-07:00","id":1562120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1561756#post1561756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The CIA doesn't have any law enforcement power in the United States and can only provide Intel in joint operations if I recall correctly. But they have been caught before ignoring that detail.</div> </div> </div> </div>The CIA doesn't have any law enforcement power anywhere. As any Intelligence Agency, their job is to gather information, and any foreign operation without consent by local law is illegal, no matter its status within the US.<br /> <br /> I'd like to remind you that the US is not a police force internationally recognized, and outside its own borders any US agent engaging in such operations are criminals, which includes those involved in recent Latin America actions and the murder of Khamenei.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkKing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1562010#post1562010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What a shocker, that the organization given the task of carrying out assassinations of foreign leaders would be involved with clandestined operations.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's actually bullshit.<br /> <br /> What extensive analysis, investigations, leaks and all from the CIA have shown is that they actually never killed a country leader.<br /> <br /> US internal propaganda likes to paint this image of the CIA traveling abroad and killing dictators over the world, but the reality is that they just don't. Most dictators are fine, and when they die it's usually at the hands of locals, even if CIA approval may exist.<br /> <br /> Now, there are recorded attempts, but they did not succeed and the whole idea was scrapped out eventually. World leaders dropping dead of unknown causes or by hidden snipers is just not something that you see outside movies.<br /> <br /> Instead, they work far more with local groups that in their own. There are several confirmed operations where the CIA financed or offered training for local allies to foment changes, although those were more frequently to install dictators than remove them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502231-feel-free-to-gush?p=1562074#post1562074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The trailer for Avengers Doomsday seems okay, but it didn't get the same reaction out of me when I saw Supergirl Woman of Tomorrow trailer drop. Maybe later trailers will make me more interested.<br /> <br /> Though seeing Robert Downey Jr doing a Eastern European accent was a selling point.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not that much into Avengers, but I still didn't watch Supergirl and really want to. Also the Superman from Gunn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-24T18:11:24-07:00","id":1562135,"title":"","content":"I'll definitely be waiting for Supergirl on DVD and Blu-ray where I can watch in the comfort of my home and be able to adjust the volume and not feel chilly in the theater.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-26T05:31:22-07:00","id":1562181,"title":"","content":"<