k":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-21T22:01:25-07:00","id":1563329,"title":"","content":"It would have been interesting to see a different Avengers roster be made into a movie with Thor, Sam Wilson, Iron Heart, Hawkeye and Spider Man. But alas it was not in the cards. But I'm hopeful that the upcoming Avengers Doomsday movie will be good and that there is still life left in the genre.<br /> <br /> On a different track I'm quite happy that I purchased the Necron Codex from Games Workshop and learning more about this incredibly ancient and immensely powerful faction who technology isn't to far from magic when the less advanced groups encounter them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 08-22-2026, 01:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-22T08:18:04-07:00","id":1563338,"title":"","content":"Nothing like arriving at a planet to find out it's a Necron cemetery ready to wake up.<br /> <br /> I'm not a fan of 40k, but with half my friends and my wife being fans, I have no &quot;not know&quot; option.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-22T12:01:44-07:00","id":1563345,"title":"","content":"I'm still learning lots about the lore of Warhammer 40K and some of the older contradictory history from the early stages. I learned more stuff about the Adeptus Custodes and how they differ drastically from the Adeptus Astartes aka Space Marines.<br /> <br /> The Custodes are not mass produced like the Marines and are slowly and painstakingly handcrafted at a much earlier age and serve multiple functions unlike their &quot;cousins&quot;<br /> <br /> So I can totally see that female Custodes are possible but not super common as the noble families of Terra would want the bloodlines to continue. Sometimes change is needed to keep an IP going.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-24T19:14:45-07:00","id":1563444,"title":"","content"